# 10up Block Components

This is a collection of React components, hooks, and utilities built for the WordPress Block Editor (Gutenberg).

## General Guidelines

- Use TypeScript for all new code
- Follow WordPress coding standards and best practices
- Components should be modular and reusable
- React functional components with hooks are preferred over class components
- Use named exports rather than default exports
- Export components from index.ts files
- All components should have appropriate PropTypes or TypeScript interfaces
- Write well-documented code with JSDoc comments

## Coding Style

- Use tabs for indentation
- Follow ESLint rules as configured in the project
- Use async/await for asynchronous code
- Use @emotion/styled for styling components
- Use WordPress i18n functions for translatable strings
- Use WordPress dependencies through imports, not global variables
